Game UI fonts - AXIS, Trump Gothic, Jupiter
-------------------------------------------
Not bundled. Dalamud builds these at runtime from the font files in the user's
own game installation, so no font data from the game is contained in this
repository or in the released plugin. These typefaces are commercial faces
licensed by Square Enix for use in the game and are not redistributable.


Eorzean alphabet font
---------------------
NOT INCLUDED, and deliberately so.

The plugin's decode effect can render text in the Eorzean alphabet if a font
for it is present, but no such font is shipped. The fan-made TTF in common
circulation records, in its own metadata:

    Copyright     (C) Eorzea font was created by Square Enix
    Copyright     Original (C) Square Enix.
    Description   Eorzea Font from Final Fantasy XIV. Font originally created
                  by Square Enix.

It carries no licence field and grants no rights, so it cannot be
redistributed under the GPL or any other licence this project could offer.

The effect degrades gracefully in its absence: FontService.TryBuildEorzean
treats a missing font as normal and the reveal falls back to a plain fade.
Users who hold such a font may place it in a "Fonts" folder beside the plugin
DLL, where FontService.FindBundledFont will pick it up.


